**2. Manufacturers – Shifting from a linear to a circular economy**

| Circular‑economy lever | Specific measures | Social & environmental upside |
|------------------------|-------------------|------------------------------|
| **Product design** | • Adopt durability standards (e.g., minimum 10‑year lifespan).<br>• Engineer modular components that can be upgraded or replaced without discarding the whole product.<br>• Use design‑for‑disassembly guidelines to simplify recycling. | Extends product life, reduces raw‑material extraction, and creates jobs in refurbishment and component manufacturing. |
| **Take‑back & refurbishment** | • Set up producer‑managed collection points (in‑store, municipal drop‑off, or courier pick‑up).<br>• Establish certified refurbishment facilities that restore returned items to “like‑new” condition for resale or lease.<br>• Offer product‑as‑a‑service (e.g., appliance leasing) to keep ownership and responsibility with the manufacturer. | Cuts landfill waste, lowers demand for virgin inputs, and generates skilled employment in repair and remanufacturing. |
| **Material loops** | • Switch to recycled or bio‑based feedstocks for non‑critical components (e.g., recycled plastics, sustainably sourced biopolymers).<br>• Partner with recyclers to close loops for hard‑to‑recycle materials (e.g., rare earths, composite fibers).<br>• Implement internal material‑recovery systems (scrap shredding, closed‑loop casting). | Reduces greenhouse‑gas emissions from extraction and processing, and diminishes supply‑chain vulnerabilities. |
| **Energy & process upgrades** | • Install on‑site renewable generation (solar, wind) and purchase green electricity contracts.<br>• Adopt digital twins and AI‑driven process optimisation to minimise waste and energy use. | Lowers carbon footprint and operational costs, creating a more resilient production base. |

**3. Data‑privacy – Balancing personalised services with robust protection in AI‑driven platforms**

| Pillar | Policy/mechanism | How it works |
|-------|------------------|--------------|
