* Compile a full mission report (design, execution, outcomes, anomalies).  
* Host an international workshop (6 months after final orbit confirmation) to capture lessons for future threats with shorter lead times.  
* Update the global planetary‑defense playbook and incorporate any procedural improvements into the next **Planetary Defense Review Cycle** (every 5 years).

