| 2‑3  | 4 hrs (≈15 % of load)    | 45 % reduction |
| 4‑5  | ≤2 hrs (≤10 % of load)   | 70 % reduction |

The reduction schedule is tied to the gradual commissioning of PV, wind, and hydro plus the battery’s ability to cover peak periods.

