| **Skill‑Swap Workshops** | Short (2‑hour) hands‑on sessions where participants teach each other a theater‑related skill – e.g., “Design a Set in 3 Hours”, “DIY Sound‑Design with Mobile Apps”, “Acting for TikTok”. Credit earned can be displayed on a personal “badge” page on the theater’s website. | Monthly, rotating topics. |
