| **Campus Ambassador Program** | • Recruit 1‑2 student ambassadors at each nearby college.<br>• Give them a small stipend + free tickets for promoting events on campus bulletin boards, Discord servers, and class announcements.<br>• Track referrals via unique QR‑code links. |
| **Email & SMS Micro‑Updates** | • Collect phone numbers at ticket purchase (opt‑in).<br>• Send a concise “What’s On Tonight?” text the day of the event plus a “Last‑Minute Discount” code. |
