| **Living shorelines** – replace hard armoring in selected bays with native vegetation, oyster reefs, and engineered bio‑rocks. | Improves shoreline stability while preserving habitat. | • Identify 4‑5 pilot sites where existing bulkheads are aging.<br>• Apply for state coastal restoration grants (typically 30 % match required). |
