| **Optional** | Desert night under the stars (Day 4) **or** Atlas Mountains day trip (Day 3) – both included |
| **Unique Aspects** | Interaction with local artisans (pottery, weaving, wood‑carving, spice‑stall); overnight stay in a traditional riad (Days 1‑5) |
