### 2. Hybrid generation mix (first‑phase, 3‑year build)  

| Technology | Approx. Capacity | Share of daily energy demand* |
|------------|------------------|------------------------------|
| Solar PV (ground‑mount + rooftop) | 300 kW (≈1 MW p total) | 35 % |
| Small‑scale wind turbines (2‑3 units, 10 kW each) | 20–30 kW | 10 % (seasonal) |
| Micro‑hydro (run‑of‑river) | 5–10 kW (continuous) | 15 % |
| Existing diesel generators (backup) | 200 kW (peak) | 40 % (initially) |

*Based on an estimated peak demand of ~300 kW and an average daily load of ~150 kWh.

