### 5. Basic economic & financing outline  

* **Capital cost (first 3 years):**  
  * Solar PV – ≈ US$1.0 M  
  * Wind turbines – ≈ US$150 k  
  * Micro‑hydro – ≈ US$80 k  
  * Battery storage – ≈ US$300 k  
  * Controls & installation – ≈ US$120 k  
  * **Total ≈ US$1.65 M**

