| **Pets & livestock** – Move animals to the highest dry ground you can find. Use temporary fencing or sturdy rope to keep them contained until permanent repairs are made. | Keeps animals safe from contaminated water and predators. |
| **Personal health** – Wear waterproof boots, gloves, and long sleeves when moving debris. Wash hands thoroughly afterward. | Reduces cuts, infections, and exposure to contaminants. |

---

