**Bottom line:** By combining producer‑centric economic levers (EPR, bans, design standards) with robust recycling infrastructure upgrades, clear consumer incentives (DRS, education), and a coordinated policy framework, governments can shift the plastic system from a linear “take‑make‑dispose” model toward a circular economy that reduces waste, protects marine ecosystems, and creates new market opportunities. --> Text length need to be between 0 and 5000 characters

