| 10‑11 | **Send a brief email blast** to the shelter’s mailing list featuring 3 senior dogs, the adoption‑fee discount (see Week 3), and a link to schedule a meet‑and‑greet. | Directly contacts people who have already shown interest. |
| 12‑13 | **Partner with one local business** (e.g., a pet store or coffee shop) to display a small poster or flyer with a QR code to the senior‑dog page. Offer the business a “thank‑you” shout‑out on social media. | Extends reach beyond the shelter’s own audience. |
| 14   | **Update the website home page** with a banner that says “Meet Our Senior Dogs – Adopt Today!” linking to a simple landing page that lists the senior dogs and their spotlights. | Gives website visitors an easy entry point. |

