### Week 10 – Interactive Visualizations II: Storytelling & Navigation
- **Learning Objectives**: Chain multiple visual components into a narrative flow; implement page navigation and storytelling cues.
- **Readings**: Segel & Heer, "Narrative Visualization" (IEEE TVCG).
- **Tools**: R Shiny or Streamlit (Python).
