### Implementation Timeline (high‑level)

| Phase | Years | Key Milestones |
|-------|-------|----------------|
| **Phase 1 – Foundations** | 0‑2 | PAYT pilot, dual‑stream bins rollout, MRF capacity boost, route‑planning software installation |
| **Phase 2 – Organics & WtE** | 2‑5 | Build compost sites, start AD pilot, incinerator retrofit, landfill‑ban ordinance for organics |
