### 1. Map the cultural landscape early
| Action | Why it matters |
|--------|----------------|
| Identify the iwi (tribe) or hapū (sub‑tribe) whose tā moko traditions you want to reference. | Tā moko designs are tied to specific whakapapa (genealogy) and tribal histories; using the right community shows respect and avoids mis‑attribution. |
