|----------|----------------|-----------|
| **Radar ranging & Doppler** (Goldstone, European VLBI) | 1 km precision | Within 24 h, then weekly for 3 months |
| **Optical astrometry** (global network) | < 0.1 arcsec | Daily for first month, then bi‑weekly |
| **Spectroscopic verification** | Confirm no fragmentation | Immediately after impact, then monthly |
