---

### Quick Checklist for the First Launch Week

- [ ] Box spec sheet finalized  
- [ ] Cost sheet and price set  
- [ ] Packaging order placed  
- [ ] Shipping partner selected & account created  
- [ ] Landing page live with payment integration  
- [ ] First 20‑subscriber discount code generated  
- [ ] Social‑media teaser schedule posted  
- [ ] Referral program built into the checkout flow  
- [ ] Weekly feedback form link added to delivery email  

