## 2. Weekly Workflow (30‑minute “tech window” each session)

| Day | Focus | Tech Activity | Coach Action |
|-----|-------|----------------|--------------|
| **Monday** | Tactical review | Upload Friday game clips to **Coach’s Eye**; create 2‑minute highlight reel. | Lead a 10‑minute group video session – point out one good decision and one improvement for the whole team. |
| **Tuesday** | Physical load monitoring | Export GPS/HR data from the previous week. | Produce a simple spreadsheet (or use the **TeamSnap** “stats” tab) showing each player’s total distance, sprint count, and average HR zone. Adjust Tuesday’s conditioning drill (e.g., reduce high‑intensity reps for players who exceeded the load threshold). |
