| Smart polymer nutrient membranes | Nutrient imbalance & waste | Voltage‑controlled, on‑demand release | –25 % to –35 % total nutrient use; stable EC/pH |
| Root‑zone microbial film | Water use, disease pressure, nutrient loss | Engineered consortium with sensor‑linked gene circuits | –30 % misting energy; +10‑15 % nutrient recapture; reduced pesticide use |

*Values are projected based on preliminary bench‑scale data and comparable literature; they would need validation in full‑scale urban vertical farms.  

